<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places 3.786 credit in money mkt.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places 3.786 credit in money mkt.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico completed three credit auctions totalling 3.786 billion pesos on the secondary market on Friday.</p>
<p>   CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     AVERAGE</p>
<p>1.393 bln pesos  14 days  25.24 pct</p>
<p>1.393 bln pesos  12 days  25.14 pct</p>
<p>1.000 bln pesos   4 days  25.08 pct</p>
<p>The minimum, maximum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9559</p>
</text>
